73	 * Zimmermann site — see the build plan's §2 "Interim data source"): this hook is the temporary,
74	 * browser-tracked stand-in for Einstein's own view-history tracking. It answers two questions:
75	 * "has this shopper viewed anything?" (`hasRecentlyViewed`, `recentlyViewedIds`) and "record that
76	 * this product was just viewed" (`markProductViewed`) — both backed by this browser's own
77	 * storage rather than a server-side recommendation engine.
78	 *
