80	 * (`useRecentlyViewedGate.ts`):** the old design was
81	 * `hasRecentlyViewed = sessionFlagIsSet || isRegistered` — a deliberate short-circuit trusting
82	 * that a logged-in shopper has *some* server-side Einstein history even on a fresh device. That
83	 * assumption does not hold once Einstein is out of the loop: there is no server-side history left
84	 * to trust. Built with the old formula, every registered shopper would show
85	 * `hasRecentlyViewed: true` unconditionally — including one who has never viewed anything in this
86	 * interim system on any device — gating the rail *open* with zero real cards behind it. The
