106	 * empty/`false` on every render and are only ever resolved inside the effect below, so there is
107	 * no storage access during the render pass SSR reproduces — no hydration mismatch, since the rail
108	 * this gates does not exist on first paint either way.
109	 *
110	 * @returns `hasRecentlyViewed` — `true` once this browser has recorded at least one viewed
111	 *   product in the appropriate store, `false` otherwise (including on the very first render,
112	 *   before this hook's own effect has resolved). `recentlyViewedIds` — the stored IDs,
113	 *   most-recent-first. `markProductViewed` — call with a product ID to record a view; safe to
114	 *   call unconditionally, never throws.
115	 */
